   e89f73db901176186b806f63bb13335422dc91b9. That code is licensed under the
   GNU General Public License, version 3. Only the numerical outputs of
   running it are included here; no file of that repository is copied,
   vendored or modified in this tree. How the numbers were produced is in
   that folder's PROVENANCE.md. The method and the figure they reproduce come
   from the paper the code accompanies; please cite it:

     M. Navarro, A. González Lorente, P. V. Parellada, C. Pascual-García
     and M. Araújo, "Finite-size quantum key distribution rates from
     Rényi entropies using conic optimization", arXiv:2511.10584.

